.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt CLOCK_GET 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm clock_get
.Nd read a clock
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Ft int
.Fn clock_get "u32 clock_id" "Timespec *out"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The .Nm system call reads the selected clock into .Fa out.
.Pp
This page documents the native RavenBSD ABI; see the
.Pa raven-abi
crate for the exact numeric value and types.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
On success .Nm returns a non-negative value; on failure it returns a negative error number.
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
